        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This discussion summarizes the scope and methodology of a project involving the analysis of fault seals and their stability in Okan field of the Niger delta hydrocarbon province. Good seismic and well data together with a working conceptual model promise to improve our understanding of the fault sealing process and the breaching of such faults through time.",
